      "locale": "en",
      "title": "How to Solve NYT Connections: A Strategic Guide for Every Puzzle",
      "description": "Beat NYT Connections with a repeatable method: read the difficulty colors, spot red herrings, start from certainty, and untangle the Purple group. Real tactics, not luck.",
      "image": "/images/connections-solving-guide-cover.svg",
      "slug": "/how-to-solve-connections",
      "tags": "connections,nyt connections,strategy,puzzle,word game,guide,purple group",
