        "title": "Sharing Puzzle Results: How the Emoji Grid Took Over, and What Comes Next",
        "description": "The green-and-yellow square grid did more for Wordle than any advertising could. Why that format worked, how Strands and Connections adapted it, and what to do when squares are not enough.",
        "image": "/images/sharing-puzzle-results-cover.svg",
