      "locale": "en",
      "title": "The Daily Puzzle Recap: Why Publishing Every Morning Is Harder Than It Looks",
      "description": "Wordle and Connections recaps have to ship before the audience has already solved it. What that deadline does to a production workflow, and the conventions that survived it.",
      "image": "/images/puzzle-recap-channels-cover.svg",
      "slug": "/puzzle-recap-channels",
      "tags": "wordle,connections,strands,content,recaps,daily publishing",
      "date": "2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z",
